  "user_direction": "Develop Gin Vetiver - Cypress Air as a full 30 mL eau de parfum rather than a fresh cologne, with additional body and functional layering. Keep cypress light, permit Hedione without constructing a jasmine accord, and ensure DEP is not deliberately present at a level capable of adding its own odor.",
  "batch_size_authority": "USER_REQUESTED_FULL_30ML_COMPOSITION_AND_REJECTED_MANDATORY_SMALL_TRIAL",
  "target_ideal": "Dry juniper and coriander through bitter grapefruit, petitgrain and a restrained cypress accent into recognizable Indian vetiver, multiple dry wood planes, mineral amber and a two-depth musk finish. The post-opening body must read as EDP structure rather than citrus cologne.",
